static const char body_13_3[] =
    "0Every equation must balance in units.\n"
    "0Checking them catches most algebra\n"
    "0mistakes for free.\n"
    "0\n"
    "1Base dimensions\n"
    "2M mass, L length, T time\n"
    "0\n"
    "1Common dimensions\n"
    "2velocity      L/T\n"
    "2acceleration  L/T^2\n"
    "2force         M*L/T^2\n"
    "2energy        M*L^2/T^2\n"
    "2power         M*L^2/T^3\n"
    "2pressure      M/(L*T^2)\n"
    "2momentum      M*L/T\n"
    "0\n"
    "1Using it\n"
    "0If a result comes out in m/s and you\n"
    "0wanted a force, something is wrong.\n"
    "0If an exam answer is 10^6 times too\n"
    "0big, look for a prefix you forgot to\n"
    "0convert.\n"
    "0\n"
    "1Deriving a formula's shape\n"
    "0The pendulum period can only be built\n"
    "0from L and g:\n"
    "2sqrt(L/g) has units of seconds\n"
    "0which gives T = 2*pi*sqrt(L/g) up to\n"
    "0the dimensionless constant.\n"
    "0\n"
    "1Rules\n"
    "3Only quantities with the same\n"
    "3\001dimensions can be added.\n"
    "3Arguments of sin, ln and e^x must\n"
    "3\001be dimensionless.";

